      <h1 class="balance">What we learned running Crossplane in production for 18 months</h1>
      <p class="article-dek pretty">Composition functions, provider upgrades, and the reconciliation edge cases nobody warns you about — plus the architecture we'd recommend, and the two patterns we'd skip if we started over today.</p>
      <div class="byline">
        <span class="avatar">YI</span>
        <div>
          <div class="who">Platform Team</div>
